# --- @fill: choosing the auxiliary -------------------------------------------
# `sinn` for movement and change of state (plus sinn/bleiwen); `hunn` otherwise.
# This is the lesson's highest-value habit, so it gets the most fills.

@fill
@lu Mäi Kolleeg [huet] gëschter bis aacht Auer geschafft.
@en My colleague [worked] until eight o'clock yesterday.
@distractor-lu ass
@distractor-lu sinn
@distractor-lu hunn
@distractor-en was
@distractor-en were
@distractor-en is

